# Cloudflare Workers static assets have a 25 MiB per-file limit.
# These raw wasm files are unused: the workers load the gzipped copies in
# public/ffmpeg and public/ort instead, which fit the limit and work on every host.
ffmpeg/ffmpeg-core.wasm
_next/static/media/ort-wasm-simd-threaded.asyncify.*.wasm
